	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>D<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>. <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p18399">Grey</persName>, <placeName ref="l830">Anglorum</placeName> regis locum tenens in villa Boloniae, in isto praelio <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>primus dux aequitum<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">= equitum.</note> <placeName ref="l830">Anglorum</placeName>, extincto maiorum bombardarum impetu <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>primam aciem <placeName ref="l2524">Scotorum</placeName> cum equitibus adoriebatur, ut ordinem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>interturbaret.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Frustratus sua spe coactus est retrocedere caesis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>48 aequitibus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Comes de <placeName ref="l3029">Warwycke</placeName>, qui sagittarios duxerat, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>animadvertens aequitum vires inclinare, cum 4000 sagittariis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>extemplo ac subito illam partem <placeName ref="l2524">Scotorum</placeName> exercitus obpungna<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>vit, ubi maiores bombarde et belli apparatus essent.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Telorum<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> Telarum.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ictu ita <placeName ref="l2524">Scotos</placeName> molestavit, ut a bombardarum custodia <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>coacti sunt discere<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">= discedere. - In einigen mittelalterlichen Handschriften ist diese Form ebenfalls belegt.</note>; quibus potitis bombardarum globulis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ac sagittariorum telis coegit universum <placeName ref="l2524">Scotorum</placeName> exercitum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>a loco, in quo prius erat, distere, ubi non tantum a facie et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>a tergo hostes habebat, sed etiam solem adversum illorum oculos <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>radiis verberantem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod, cum videret d. <persName ref="p18399">Graey</persName>, a latere <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>cum equitibus iterum magno impetu tendit cum clamore <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ac sonitu magno, clamantes: "<placeName ref="l2524">Scoti</placeName> fugiunt, <placeName ref="l2524">Scoti</placeName> fugiunt."<pb type="scan" next="v."/></s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><placeName ref="l2524">Scoti</placeName> aequitum viribus inferiores ordinem belli minime servare valebant, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>quo perturbato fugam sibi optabant, in qua ceciderunt 15000 et <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>capti sunt 2000, inter quos et d. <persName>Huntlod</persName>, primus canselari[us]<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Hier und unten Text teils im engen Einband verdeckt.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>regni Scociae.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Eo die naves <placeName ref="l830">Angli</placeName> appulerunt in<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Erwartet wäre</hi> varios portus.</note> variis<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> varis.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l2524">Scotorum</placeName> ac ceperunt omnes naves, quae vel ad mercaturam vel <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>navale bellum erant idonee.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Caeteras combusserunt.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Regina audito <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>hoc infoelici nuncio optulit sese protectori ad quasc[unque] <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>condiciones, ipse optaret.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Protector acceptis sex nobilibus, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>qui pro fide regine sunt obsides, relictis copiis in 5 locis <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>regni Scociae, ne in illius absencia sedicio oriretur, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>reversus est <placeName ref="l296">Londinum</placeName>, ubi brevi expectatur sinodus, in <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>qua hec discordia, si deus velit, dirimetur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Hec vera <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>sunt, nam qui ad me scripserit, interfuit bello et exhaustam <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>vidit pugnam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Tuae praestantiae semper studiosus</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/><persName ref="p1560">Ioannes Hoperu<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>s</persName><lb xml:id="p2z18"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Numerus militum utriusque exercitus: <lb xml:id="p2z20"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglorum</placeName> 17 millia; <lb xml:id="p2z22"/><placeName ref="l2524">Scotorum</placeName> 30 millia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Ohne Adresse.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
